OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely fine and dry day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine, although the odd
OL,7,Fshower is possible during the morning.
OL,8,FTurning cloudier in the far west
OL,9,Flater. Breezy, but feeling very warm,
OL,10,Fespecially in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine evening in the east,
OL,13,Fbut cloud and patchy rain will move
OL,14,Finto the west, before spreading
OL,15,Feastwards overnight. A mild if not
OL,16,Frather humid night to come.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
