OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA rather grey start with some
OL,6,Fpatchy rain or drizzle, especially
OL,7,Fover hills. Turning brighter towards
OL,8,Flunchtime, with some sunshine
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Feeling a little fresher
OL,10,Fwith temperatures nearer to average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FSunshine and showers on Tuesday,
OL,14,Falthough showers easing later. Mostly
OL,15,Ffine and dry Wednesday and initially
OL,16,FThursday, before some patchy rain
OL,17,Farrives later. Feeling a little cool
OL,18,Ffor early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
